  "releaseNotes": "Email attachments and an optional sender. ExbilCoreEmailSentRequestModel takes an Attachments list (new ExbilCoreEmailAttachment, with FromBytes/FromFile helpers so callers never encode base64 themselves) and an optional SenderName; ContentId marks a part inline for cid: references from an HTML body. SenderFrom is no longer required — omitted, the send goes out under the App's own configured sender identity. Additive, non-breaking: existing calls compile and behave as before.",
